CONFIGURE OBS:
CONFIGURE OBS:
	https://chatgpt.com/share/6a6adba7-1b24-83e8-9068-395d7cda8ee6
	File -> Settings
		>> Output >> Output Mode: Advanced
			>> Recording >> Type: Standard
			>> Recording >> Recording Format: MKV
			>> Recording >> Video Encoder: QuickSync AV1
			>> Recording >> Audio Track 1,2,3
				>> Encoder Settings >>
					Rate Control: ICQ
					ICQ Quality: 18
					Keyframe Interval: 2s
			>> Audio >>
				Track 1 Name: Everything
				Track 2 Name: Game Only
				Track 3 Name: Microphone only
			>> Replay Buffer >>
				Enabled Reply Buffer
				Maximum Replay Time: 1200s
				Maximum Memory: 7000MB
		>> Hotkeys >>
			Start Replay Buffer: Ctrl + Shift + R
			Stop Replay Buffer: Ctrl + Shift + S
			>> Replay buffer >> Save Replay: F10
		>> Advanced >> 
			>> General >> Process Priority: Above Normal
			>> Video >> Color Format: NV12
			>> Recording >> Automatically remux to mp4
	APPLY SETTINGS
	
	Sources:
		Add new (plus sign)
			-> Game Capture (make sure RuneLite is running)
				-> Add 1 existing >> then double click it 
					>> Mode: capture specific window
					>> Window: [RuneLite.exe] RuneLite
				-> Drag to max view inside display
			-> Audio Input Capture
				-> Device: Open run Headphones
					-> right click and rename: Open Shocks Mic
					-> right click filters
						-> add gain filter +2db
	Audio Mixer:
		-10db for Desktop audio



CONFIGURE RUNELITE:
CONFIGURE RUNELITE:
-------------------------->> turn on <<----------------------
	Quest Helper
	GPU or 117 HD
	Tile Indicators
		-> highlight true tile
		-> destination tile
		-> current target
	Ground Items
		-> hide junk items
		-> highlight valueable drops
		-> set minimum loot notification around 1k-2k early game
		-> minimum highlighted value: 1000
		-> Hidden items: enabled
		-> Notify on value drops: 10,000gp
	Bank Tags
	Bank Value
	Menu entry Swapper
		Left-click Bank instead of Talk-to
		Left-click Exchange at the Grand Exchange
		Left-click Climb on ladders
		Shift-click Drop for power training
	Inventory Tags
	World Hopper
	Timers
	Xp Tracker
	Idle Nofier
	Entity Hider
	Camera
		remove camera zoom limits
		middle-mouse camera
		allow vertical camera
	chat filter
	ground markers
	loot tracker
	hiscores
	skill calculator
	wiki
	NPC indicators
		highlight attackable NPCs
		highlight your current target
	opponent info
	prayer
	status bars
		-> hp
		-> prayer
		-> special attack
	screenshots
	stretched mode
		-> enabled
		-> integer scaling
		-> keep aspect ratio
	visual metronome
		-> enabled
-------------------------->> turn OFF <<----------------------	
	Example
	anti drag
	mouse highlight
	loot tracker
		-> keep enabled but disable:
			loot notifications: disable
			chat spam: disable
	gpu animation smoothing
	music
	daily tasks
